Message.Solution:
There might be modeling error when linking measurements with a device in SSE.
Check steps:
1) Get device id in the error log (for example, f8f3e5b1-28aa-40b8-8db3-66a0dbc25196);
2) Find the associated measurements of the device from the station internal XML File(named station__subeditor.xml);
3) Check field MeasType and Phase,SCADA measurements of the same type and phase cannot be mapped to the same equipment;
4) If you find Multiple SCADA measurements of the same type and phase are mapped to the same equipment,For example,BAKER.FDR.5469.FAA, BAKER.FDR.5469.FAB, BAKER.FDR.5469.FAC are mapped to a device,
Correct Phase field according to the CID. For example, the Phase of BAKER.FDR.5469.FAA should be A (1),the Phase of BAKER.FDR.5469.FAB should be B (2),the Phase of BAKER.FDR.5469.FAC should be C (3).
